meta {
  name: 14 - Firebase Bootstrap For Second Chat
  seq: 15
}

docs {
  Fixed accounts:
  - User A: gtestino1992@gmail.com
  - User B: android.counterpart@example.com
  
  Set these secrets manually in the active Bruno environment:
  - firebase_api_key
  - firebase_password
  - firebase_counterpart_password
  
  This folder deliberately avoids using firebase_email and
  firebase_counterpart_email as request inputs because those generic names
  may already exist at request, folder or collection scope.
  
  Dedicated variables:
  - second_chat_user_a_email
  - second_chat_user_a_id_token
  - second_chat_user_a_uid
  - second_chat_user_b_email
  - second_chat_user_b_id_token
  - second_chat_user_b_uid
  
  Compatibility aliases are also populated, but subsequent requests in this
  package use the dedicated variables directly.
}
